      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This mod adds various 12-inch vinyl LP records based on artists that I myself made and others (Turok, Hoshizoraa, RheddElBozo) recommended.</p>\n<p>This mod will be continually updated with the planned records until completion.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YRc4yHf.png\" alt=\"YRc4yHf.png\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"vKRw58b.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Contents</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Currently this mod contains:<br />\n- A Vinyl Storage Case to hold these collectibles<br />\n- Bocchi The Rock! Records 1 and 2<br />\n- King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard’s Teenage Gizzard LP<br />\n- CASIOPEA’s Mint Jams (Standard &amp; Green Vinyl)<br />\n- Alfie Templeman’s Mellow Moon (Pink Vinyl)<br />\n- Alfie Templeman’s Radiosoul (Rare Printed Vinyl)<br />\n- Weezer’s Blue Album<br />\n- Yes’ Fragile (Original 1970s vinyl)<br />\n- Jamiroquai’s Travelling Without Moving (Deluxe Vinyl)</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YRc4yHf.png\" alt=\"YRc4yHf.png\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Planned</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>You can find my planned additions for this mod here: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://trello.com/c/QgrbfB9Q\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://trello.com/c/QgrbfB9Q</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
